# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Core development tree -- present in the working directory, NOT published.
#
# This repository publishes benchmarks/ and the root licensing documents only;
# see NOTICE.md, "What This Repository Currently Contains".  The Rocket Chip
# derivative that the benchmarks are built and run against lives alongside it
# in the same working directory and must stay out of the release until it has
# had the file-by-file licence review that benchmarks/ received.  It carries
# third-party code under several licences -- UC Berkeley BSD, SiFive, Apache
# 2.0, MIT, and Mulan PSL v2 (XiangShan / Peng Cheng Laboratory, and Axelera
# AI's DiffTest) -- plus patches against GPL-2 projects and prebuilt jars.
#
# Every rule below is anchored with a leading "/" so it matches only at the
# repository root.  Without the anchor, "src/", "scripts/", "Makefile" and
# "LICENSE" would also shadow tracked files inside benchmarks/.
#
# When the core is published, delete this block rather than un-ignoring a
# directory at a time.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# RTL, generators and their vendored dependencies
/src/
/chisel3/
/firrtl/
/hardfloat/
/macros/
/api-config-chipsalliance/
/DRAMSIM3/

# Simulation, test and build infrastructure
/emulator/
/vsim/
/bootrom/
/riscv-tests/
/torture/
/regression/
/scripts/
/patches/
/project/

# Root-level core build files
/build.sbt
/Makefile
/Makefrag
/ivydependencies.json
/mkJunit.py
/set_env.sh
/riscv-tools.hash
/sbt-launch.jar

# Prebuilt third-party jars (binaries, shipped without source)
*.jar

# GitHub templates belonging to the upstream core project
/.github/

# Licence texts for the core's third-party dependencies.  These ship with the
# core, not with benchmarks/.  LICENSES/LicenseRef-Intensivate-NC-1.0.txt is
# tracked and deliberately not listed here.
/LICENSE
/LICENSE.Apache2
/LICENSE.Berkeley
/LICENSE.jtag
/LICENSE.MulanPSL2
/LICENSE.SiFive
/NOTICE
/LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
/LICENSES/BSD-3-Clause.txt
/LICENSES/LicenseRef-chisel-jtag.txt
/LICENSES/LicenseRef-SiFive-Apache-2.0.txt
/LICENSES/MulanPSL-2.0.txt
